          <li>Rimfolk_Camp_Catchers</li>
        </camps>
        <plan>Rimfolk_Plan_WardensLodge</plan>
        <honours>the lantern kept lit, the book's last line and a steady hand at the crossroads</honours>
        <fears>the beast that gets away, a dark crossroads and the empty page</fears>
        <sayings>
          <li>Where a lantern burns, someone was taken.</li>
          <li>Keep it lit until it is done.</li>
          <li>A beast that takes a person answers for it.</li>
